# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# THIS FILE IS NOT THE PRIMARY REDIRECT MECHANISM AND IS INERT ON GITHUB PAGES.
#
# Every rule below is also shipped as a real HTML stub generated by
# jekyll-redirect-from (`redirect_from:` / `redirect_to:` front matter), because
# those work on any static host and GitHub Pages — the current production origin —
# ignores this file entirely. This file exists so behaviour is identical if the site
# is ever moved to Cloudflare Pages, where an edge rule beats a meta-refresh hop.
#
# Keep the two in sync. script/redirects.tsv names the owner of each path, and CI
# asserts the stubs exist. Nothing asserts this file, so it is the half that rots.
#
# Off-site targets: Cloudflare Redirect Rules on the openmaptiles.org zone already
# answer /support/, /terms/, /hosting/, /coordinate-systems/, /extracts/,
# /production-package/, /downloads/, /downloads/embed/ and
# /docs/website/openlayers3/ at the edge, ahead of the origin. The targets below were
# read back off production on 2026-08-03 so all three layers agree. Several targets
# this file previously carried did NOT agree — they were inherited from a generated
# artifact and had drifted from the live rules.

